==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*3 [[Zomboe]]s spawn, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Katsumi Orochi (Enemy)|Katsumi Orochi]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is similar in difficulty to an early EoC Chapter 1 [[Zombie Outbreaks|outbreak]] stage. None of the enemies here are actually deadly, so bring any generic [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|anti-Zombie counters]] to win.

